{
	"name": "Instant Crenelations",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/environment/settlement/city-wall.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>As a bonus action, you can raise up a stone and earthen crenelation out of the ground in a 5ft square. This crenelation provides half cover. Alternatively you can spend 1 exertion as a reaction to being targeted by a ranged attack or area of effect spell to create such a crenelation to benefit from half cover. In either case the crenelations you create collapse after 1 minute.</p>",
